#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:22
#: config/apps/io.github.lyricat.Inua.SpacePinball.desktop:3
msgid "Space Pinball"
msgstr "Pinball espacial"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:23
msgid "Fly missions to climb the ranks, from Cadet to Fleet Admiral. Hit the three yellow mission targets to light a mission, then shoot the launch ramp (right) to accept it; the display shows what to shoot and the time left. Missions burn fuel: roll through the inlanes and the re-entry lanes to refuel. The hyperspace ramp (left) climbs five levels, lighting an extra ball at the third and paying a jackpot at the fifth. The booster bank lights Lock: lock two balls in the black hole for multiball, where the launch ramp is the jackpot. The wormhole lets the ball out of the black hole. Light all three re-entry lanes to raise the field multiplier. The plunger's pull picks the lane a launch drops into: hit the blinking one for the skill shot. Nudge to save a ball, but not too often: the table tilts. Three balls; your best score is kept."
msgstr "Vuela en misiones para ascender de rango, desde cadete hasta almirante de flota. Golpea los tres objetivos de misión amarillos para iluminar una misión, luego dispara a la rampa de lanzamiento (derecha) para aceptarla; la pantalla muestra qué disparar y el tiempo restante. Las misiones queman combustible: recorre los carriles internos y los carriles de reentrada para repostar. La rampa hiperespacial (izquierda) sube cinco niveles, enciende una bola extra en el tercero y paga un premio mayor en el quinto. Las luces del banco de refuerzo Lock: bloquea dos bolas en el agujero negro para multibola, donde la rampa de lanzamiento es el premio mayor. El agujero de gusano deja salir la bola del agujero negro. Ilumina los tres carriles de reingreso para aumentar el multiplicador de campo. El tirón del émbolo elige el carril en el que cae una lancha: golpea el que parpadea para realizar el tiro de habilidad. Empuja para salvar una pelota, pero no con demasiada frecuencia: la mesa se inclina. Tres bolas; tu mejor puntuación se mantiene."

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:24
msgid "A or ← left flipper  ·  D or → right flipper  ·  hold Space to pull the plunger  ·  X . ↑ nudge  ·  M sound  ·  P pause  ·  N new game"
msgstr "A o ← aleta izquierda · D o → aleta derecha · mantenga presionado Espacio para tirar del émbolo · X . ↑ empujar · Sonido M · Pausa P · N juego nuevo"

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:27
msgid "A property game for two to four players, people at the screen taking turns, people in a browser on the same network (set On the network: the lobby shows the link and its QR code) and computer players, on a ring of 80 squares with two branch roads (at a fork, chance picks the road), in Tokyo, New York, Shanghai or Rome: choose the city, the rounds, the starting money, your rivals and the rules (one die or two; building on a street the turn you buy it) before you start. The board is larger than the window: drag it, scroll, or use the arrow keys to look about; Home brings you back to your pawn. Roll the dice and walk the board; with two, a double rolls again and three in a row go to jail. Buy the streets, ferry piers and utilities you land on; rivals landing there pay you rent. Every street of yours your pawn passes or lands on may go up one level that turn (outlined on the board): house by house to four, then a hotel; owning a whole colour group doubles its bare rent and adds half to its built rents. Piers pay more the more of them you own; utilities charge by the dice. Passing Start pays $400. Taxes and fines fill the fountain, and whoever lands there takes it. Cards come from Chance and the card shops, where you may buy any of the three on offer; hold up to ten, and play any number in your turn, before you roll or after you move: Loaded Dice, Free Rent, Requisition, Pickpocket, Demolition, Building Permit, Turtle, Swap Places, Jail Pass, Tax Audit, Fair Shares and Sleeping Pill. A card played on a street takes the square in focus: click it on the board first. Who cannot pay sells buildings and property at half price, or is out. After the last round, or when one player is left, the most worth wins: cash, property and buildings. Keys: Space the main action, R roll, B buy, X pass, E end turn, J pay bail, H build on the square in focus, M the sound on or off, N a new game. The sound plays through pw-cat; without it the game is silent."
msgstr ""

#: internal/gamesui/catalog.go:28
